WHAT TO PRODUCE (JSON, fields: {{ schema_fields }}):
1. `object_name` PascalCase; `summary` two sentences incl. overall size in meters and what moves.
2. `overall_bbox` — real-world dimensions in meters, authored at the REST pose; bottom at up=0.
3. `parts` = LINKS, 4 to 12. One part per rigid body that moves as a unit (a drawer is ONE link even
   if it has a front, a box and a handle — describe those sub-shapes in `description`). Each part:
   PascalCase `name`, `role`, `description` with construction numbers, `bbox` (centre + extents, meters,
   rest pose, WORLD coordinates), `attach_to` = the parent link, `material` with colour.
   Moving links must NOT penetrate their neighbours at rest: leave ≥ 0.003 m clearance in the motion
   direction (drawer vs cabinet opening, door vs frame); fixed neighbours overlap ≥ 0.002 m.
4. `root_link` — the grounded/base link (cabinet, base, chassis).
5. `joints` — one per moving link, forming a single tree from `root_link`:
   * `type` revolute (hinges, lids, doors; radians) · prismatic (drawers, slides; meters) ·
     continuous (wheels, fans) · fixed (rigid attachments you still want as separate links).
   * `axis` unit vector in the frame above; `pivot` a WORLD point on the axis at rest (the hinge line,
     the slide direction through the drawer centre).
   * `lower`/`upper` realistic limits (door 0..1.57 rad, lid 0..1.9 rad, drawer 0..0.8 × depth m);
     `rest` within the limits (usually 0 = closed).
   * `motion` one line: "lid opens upward about its back edge".
6. `acceptance` — 6 to 12 items: dimensions (`measure`), ground contact, each key feature
   (`visual`), and ONE `articulation` item per joint ("drawer slides out 0.35 m without touching the
   cabinet", "door swings 90° about the left edge, no penetration through the range").

RULES
- Sweep-safe design: imagine each joint at lower, mid and upper — no link passes through another.
  Hinged lids pivot at their back edge, NOT their centre; drawers slide along the cabinet depth.
- Pivot and axis are the contract the URDF will be checked against; choose them to 3 decimals.
- Every link except `root_link` is the child of exactly one joint; parent/child names are part names.
- No prose outside the JSON.

